# Cell 1 - Imports

```python
import pandas as pd
import numpy as np

import matplotlib.pyplot as plt
import seaborn as sns

plt.style.use("ggplot")

pd.set_option("display.max_columns", None)
pd.set_option("display.max_rows", 100)
```

