# Cell 5 - Missing Value Analysis

```python
missing = pd.DataFrame({
    "Missing Count": df.isnull().sum(),
    "Missing Percentage":
        round(
            df.isnull().mean()*100,
            2
        )
})

missing = missing.sort_values(
    by="Missing Percentage",
    ascending=False
)

missing.head(20)
```

---

# Cell 6 - Missing Value Visualization

```python
plt.figure(figsize=(12,6))

missing["Missing Percentage"] \
    .head(20) \
    .plot(kind="bar")

plt.title(
    "Top 20 Missing Columns"
)

plt.ylabel("Missing %")

plt.show()
```

