# Cell 12 - Gender Risk Analysis

```python
gender_risk = (
    df.groupby(
        "CODE_GENDER"
    )["TARGET"]
    .mean()
    .reset_index()
)

gender_risk
```

```python
sns.barplot(
    data=gender_risk,
    x="CODE_GENDER",
    y="TARGET"
)

plt.title(
    "Default Rate by Gender"
)

plt.show()
```

