# Cell 16 - Feature Engineering

```python
df[
    "CREDIT_INCOME_RATIO"
] = (
    df["AMT_CREDIT"]
    /
    (
        df["AMT_INCOME_TOTAL"]
        + 1
    )
)

df[
    "CREDIT_INCOME_RATIO"
].describe()
```

---

# Cell 17 - Credit Income Ratio vs Default

```python
sns.boxplot(
    data=df,
    x="TARGET",
    y="CREDIT_INCOME_RATIO"
)

plt.title(
    "Credit Income Ratio vs Default"
)

plt.show()
```

